## G — anything else

**R17 (G).** p. 51: *"Data, code and proofs. Placeholder. Item 11 completes this statement ..."* and *"Acknowledgements. Placeholder. ..."* Placeholder text in the built PDF; §10.2 entry 09d refers to "the assistant the acknowledgements disclose", which do not yet exist.

