**What was done**

- **Full build.** Paper 3 builds clean at 62 pages with no undefined reference or citation and, after a one-line macro fix in `main.tex`, zero overfull boxes.
- **DOI check.** A new `paper3/scripts/check_refs.py` reuses paper 1's checker. The two DOIs on file agree with their registry records. Thirteen DOIs were found by Crossref search on title and first author and added to `refs.bib`. The log of record is `paper3/latex/doi_check.log`: 22 entries, 15 with a DOI, 0 disagree. Ledger entry 10a records that Crossref was queried because the item names it.
- **Refuter pass.** One blind subagent read the whole PDF against the clone, the manuscript extract, the two audits, the replay logs, the fetched texts, the companion Lean and the measurement data. It filed 21 findings and found no scope or title problem. Every central number agreed with its source.

